# OneRoster CSV Validator

- Core requirement: manifest.csv must exist at the zip root and accurately describe the files present.
- Bulk vs Delta: Bulk rows MUST NOT have `dateLastModified` or `status`. Delta rows MUST have them. Mixed files are invalid.
- GUID Integrity: All `sourcedId` referenced must exist. Do not invent missing IDs.
- Enrollment Sanity: Each class needs a primary teacher and one student.
- Encoding: UTF-8 required. Check for stripped leading zeros (Excel corruption).
- Never auto-fix CSV files in place, produce a detailed findings report instead.
